  "prefLabel": "Fors 403.02 Requirements for New Licensees",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fors 403.02 Requirements for New Licensees. Persons licensed less than 24 months in a biennial renewal period shall obtain one unit of approved continuing education units for each month licensed up to 20 continuing education units (CEUs) as a condition of license renewal.\n\nSource. #6876, eff 10-28-98; ss by #8710, eff 8-25-06; ss by #10087, eff 3-1-12; ss by #10544, eff 3-13-14; ss by #14086, eff 11-24-24",
